course: dictionary
lesson: 11570
title: Words from church life
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: You do not need to know every word to understand a text. When you meet a new word, look at the words around it, because they give clues. «At noon the church bell rang, and everyone stopped to say the Angelus.» The bell and the word say are clues: the Angelus is something people say at a set time, and a bell calls them to it.
explain: The Angelus is a Catholic prayer. Christians believe the angel Gabriel told Mary she would be the mother of Jesus, and the prayer remembers this. It is said three times a day: in the morning, at noon and in the evening.
explain: The word also names the bell that rings to call people to pray. In «the Angelus bell», Angelus tells you which bell. Ask yourself: what would fit here? A prayer or a bell? The rest of the sentence tells you which.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: «Angelus» is a noun, and it names a Catholic prayer.
fact: «Angelus» can also name the bell that rings to call people to say the prayer.
fact: The Angelus is said in the morning, at noon and in the evening.
fact: In Ireland, RTÉ rings the Angelus bell on radio and TV at noon and at 6 pm.
exercise: «Every day at noon, the church bell rang, and the family stopped to say the Angelus.» What is the Angelus? | A song sung at school | *A Catholic prayer | A game played in church | A type of bread eaten at lunch
exercise: «The Angelus rang out across the fields.» What does this sentence tell you the Angelus is? | A painting of farm workers | *A bell | A bird that sings at dawn | A kind of food
exercise: «The Angelus is said in the morning, at noon and in the evening.» Which of these is a time when the Angelus is said? | the summer holidays | *noon | Easter | Christmas
test: Mr Okafor says, «Ring the Angelus, Tom, it's noon.» What does the Angelus mean in this sentence? | A school test | A kind of sandwich | *The bell that calls people to pray | The name of a river
test: What is the Angelus prayer about? | A famous battle in history | A storm at sea | A king who built a castle | *The angel Gabriel telling Mary she would be the mother of Jesus
exam: The painting «The Angelus» shows two farm workers stopping in a field when they hear a bell. Why do they stop? | The bell tells them the day's work is finished | They are tired and want their lunch | *They hear the Angelus bell calling them to pray | They have seen a friend across the field
